      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.37 (up from ₹1.35 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹562.0m (up 14% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹123.0m (up 1.0% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 22% (down from 25% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 34% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 30% per year.",
